  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_c62a93810e3646bea2bc508e311c617e",
      "statement": "The deployment is a single image built from the repository Dockerfile and run as two services in docker-compose.yml: `api` uses the image CMD (`uvicorn app.main:create_app --factory --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000`) and `worker` overrides it with `python -m app.worker`, so both containers execute identical code with different entrypoints.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Dockerfile#L45-L50",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:01b67deccf1aa2940ffc79e555c2b9749a65a514324def72e4b097f704cc656c:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker-compose.yml#L1-L38",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0ff479a17fe5dea7672daf2da71e943224b3d9953672ae38023a7c923dc7cf70:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ce72bb950bae4110801ce28a9f079753",
      "statement": "The OpenWiki CLI version is baked into the image at build time through the `OPENWIKI_VERSION` build arg (default 0.6.0), passed to `scripts/install-openwiki.sh` which runs `npm install --global openwiki@${OPENWIKI_VERSION}`; upgrading the CLI is therefore `docker compose build --build-arg OPENWIKI_VERSION=x.y.z` plus `docker compose up -d`, with no service code change as long as the CLI keeps its interface.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Dockerfile#L22-L25",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bd638275659b12838fba434c019dc9cbbb9a0a9f1fb7cf987b90452359c281c7:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://Dockerfile#L4-L7",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a9078789afb3ad2bb56070fa5d3f23d6964a024f37e32685b98cb7967f09a921:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L334-L346",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:93013c66adb9e25ef8ef35f59ed0022d5aa8d4301249c605f38e03232c058bcc:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/install-openwiki.sh#L7-L17",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e113890fad2123d819d2ad1f7860a6abc73f4b1b62425ac867961dee2ba3360d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e030ceabd725485ab768b5b49b8cdcab",
      "statement": "`scripts/install-openwiki.sh` performs its npm global install with `--no-fund --no-audit` and, if that fails, installs `build-essential` and retries once, because the CLI's `better-sqlite3` dependency may need to compile when no prebuilt binary matches the container's Node ABI.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/install-openwiki.sh#L1-L17",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4d5dcc938a4e62c66903912479221082a77d602cc80a974b1f2a650a4657464e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_87a86fcf4a9849d28d431488961fd3af",
      "statement": "The image runs as the unprivileged user `appuser` (uid 10001) which owns `/app` and `/data`, and it sets `git config --system --add safe.directory '*'` so git and the OpenWiki CLI accept repositories that are mounted or cloned with a different owner instead of failing with `dubious ownership`; outside Docker that setting must be replicated per path.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Dockerfile#L32-L39",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:974e4b69820cc27cb49ec3f4153d4db455d66871e6c9cb7c99179b1920e1863e:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L368-L371",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4e523b1a31cc91b4bc9ee368e144303cc96c17357dfd3b2a00e8fe68418559ee:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_881a7954471640418b38cb1e749f2e79",
      "statement": "The image declares `HEALTHCHECK ... CMD curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8000/health`, which is meaningful only for the HTTP-serving `api` container; the compose `worker` service therefore sets `healthcheck: disable: true` so worker replicas are not reported unhealthy for not listening on port 8000.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Dockerfile#L14-L20",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f6ddcb37c2048e7dd58c66a81ad9b9460c472efeffd89e9bb729f36dce62be04:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://Dockerfile#L47-L48",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ec4acfa8b05caebe9a402e3a4c8672e10b76fea43cbf5e62532ee67f4ff496d7:"
        },
        {
