          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0158fc557d2d541acce140ace68bcfa02565fc1ad1f395f6abfa19363d303900:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3fb4695e0cc64140a21d1be8508990fd",
      "statement": "The `api` and `worker` services never call each other over the network: they act on the same named volume `openwiki-ci-data` mounted at `/data` in both, which holds the SQLite queue `openwiki.db`, the per-wiki artifact tree `jobs/<wiki_id>/` (workspace, `logs.txt`, `wiki.zip`) and the CLI state directory `/data/.openwiki-config`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Dockerfile#L41-L43",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:70897e3f1d2f0add6eba812e5e2ac3cf96298a86c506644646488d972e7748a3:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L61-L65",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9f49d7c59fccd478c0a5702313f432d93093e5af2208b7e25a65eba37ac5aba4:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker-compose.yml#L17-L18",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f6496249cd43cd308c8178aca42d4cd6a9fcf8ce7d6ce5ce36312418d39e5ca0:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker-compose.yml#L34-L35",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f6496249cd43cd308c8178aca42d4cd6a9fcf8ce7d6ce5ce36312418d39e5ca0:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_41008bb668ab425e9c205d712f4db50d",
      "statement": "Because `api` and `worker` only share the volume, the API can be restarted without killing in-flight generations, and workers keep finishing claimed work even if the API is down; the only cross-actor recovery path is the lease: a claim that stops heartbeating beyond `WORKER_LEASE_SECONDS` is requeued by the API's reaper and picked up by another worker in the same workspace.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L47-L53",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0f85f2cb7fcfee955142f716ab1cfac46e1b976be29cfa7baf91b2614cfe5905:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/core/storage.py#L345-L356",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0bc515054cd31cc2129d901d5d9de545e5d0a821001c26e4b6920b65148e00f1:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/main.py#L32-L40",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8d12b2cd359a8db5a6bd6ea33e07ab6c2998440ed681b6768e630e28770b27ee:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a5cad24d60884226aff1e9ed9dc7f0de",
      "statement": "Worker capacity is scaled by replicas rather than threads: `docker compose up -d --scale worker=N` adds containers claiming from the same SQLite queue, while `MAX_CONCURRENT_JOBS` (default 1) sets how many generations a single worker container runs in parallel. Each generation spawns a long-lived CLI subprocess plus a `git clone` and a disk workspace, so raising `MAX_CONCURRENT_JOBS` multiplies those resources inside one box.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L61-L63",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3bad390664c86145b6b88a8d19576fb8f1e7419bc489a6619e981acb3ed508ac:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/core/config.py#L49-L58",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a54a5681578330690d1d25e4ef14437ccbbb1c25938593251c9f8271f8e3d8b1:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/worker/loop.py#L50-L56",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:26c66985e023b2d91d070acb8f2f3609301b35e71ce1fc521fb9c81d71f736d8:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker-compose.yml#L21-L33",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4a51aeb38a46f0b6c280c2d1b7ddfc7174bbf80e1e6d812c3422f0ca35709318:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_dcae120939aa4e5fa9119e358bf4c5bf",
      "statement": "Both compose services use `restart: unless-stopped`, the worker declares `depends_on: [api]` only to order startup, and both read the `.env` file with the long `env_file` form and `required: false`, so the stack starts even without a `.env` (though real generations then fail for lack of a model provider).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker-compose.yml#L10-L19",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6246cc48546bcf2435fdfa9f014c172df616699a3d163b4f6c6c56fcf0e1dfc0:"
        },
        {
