    },
    {
      "id": "claim_dc64919a19d842a8ac741ad25ba1b191",
      "statement": "The test suite covers the deployment's shared contracting pieces without a model provider or network: `tests/conftest.py` points `openwiki_bin` at `tests/fixtures/fake_openwiki.py` with `run_local_worker=True` to drive the real pipeline in-process, `tests/test_worker_queue.py` exercises atomic exclusive claims, heartbeat/cancel/complete with stale claim ids, stale-claim requeue and stats, and `tests/test_health.py` asserts `/health` returns `status: ok` with `pool.workers` counting the worker.",
